  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001120",
        "SRC-001121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "8 below-market units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001554"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Town Council approved the Architecture and Site, Conditional Use Permit and Vesting Tentative Map applications unanimously on June 3, 2025 (Resolution 2025-038; motion by Council Member Badame, seconded by Council Member Ristow), with a condition that the applicant incorporate the Building A design revisions in Attachment 7 and that the landscaped area not be fenced off.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003438"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Staff report: 55 live/work units in five buildings replacing the Genuine Automotive service center and a multi-suite commercial building; access from two private alleys and a guest parking driveway on Garden Lane, pedestrian-only access from Los Gatos Boulevard. Zoned CH:HEOZ. CEQA: Modified Initial Study/15168 Checklist tiered from the 2020 and 2040 General Plan EIRs.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003433"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Los Gatan reports 4 of the 55 units are live-work units, unit types range from studios to three bedrooms, and unit sizes run from 300 to 1,500 square feet.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003437"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The approved Vesting Tentative Map merges the two parcels into one condominium parcel; a Condominium Plan for the 55 units is to be recorded after construction.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003436"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Unit counts of restricted units differ: Town staff report and CEQA notice show 8 Below Market Price units; the state Annual Progress Report shows 11 deed-restricted units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003433",
        "SRC-003434"
      ]
    }
  ],
